🌅 Imaan bil Yaum al-Akhirah (Belief in the Last Day)
 Maut (Death) – Haqq hai

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📖 “Kullu nafsin zaaikatul maut” – Har nafs maut ka maza chakhne waala hai.
Maut barhaqq hai, aur maut ke baad bhi zindagi haqq hai.
(📚 Surah Insaan:1, Surah Nahl:78)

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

⚰️ Aakhirat ke Stages

🪦 1. Qabr (Grave)
Har insaan ki aakhirat uske maut ke saath hi shuru ho jaati hai.

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

⚖️ Qabr ka Imtihan:

Qabr dabaayegi — kisi ko thoda, kisi ko zyada, itna ke pasliyaan ek dusre par aa jaayengi.

❓ Qabr ke Sawaal:

1️⃣ Tumhara Rabb kaun hai?
2️⃣ Tumhara Deen kya hai?
3️⃣ Tumhara Nabi kaun hai?

👉 Jo duniya mein tawheed par jama raha, wahi in sawaalon ke sahi jawaab de sakega.

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌸 Naik logon ke liye:

Qabr badi kar di jaayegi
Roshni bhar di jaayegi
Rooh ko jannat le jaaya jaayega

🔥 Gunehgaaron ke liye:

Qabr ka azaab bohot sakht hoga
Cheekh pukar karenge

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌍 Yaum-ul-Akhirah (Qayamat ka Din)

📣 1. Nafkh-e-Ula (Pehli Soor)

Israfeel (AS) Allah ke izn se soor phoonkenge
Ye achaanak hoga jab log apne kaamon mein mashghool honge
Sab log mar jaayenge
Zameen ki sab cheezen reza-reza ho jaayengi
Zameen ek gol, safed roti ki tarah ho jaayegi


____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📣 2. Nafkh-e-Thaniya (Doosri Soor)

Doosri martaba phoonka jaayega
Sab log dobara zinda ho jaayenge
Rooh aur jism mil jaayega
Sab qabron se nikal kar groups mein aayenge, jaise tiddiyan

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🏜️ Hashr (Resurrection & Gathering)

Sooraj bohot qareeb hoga, garmi sakht hogi
Har shaqs akela hoga
Koi kisi ka madadgaar nahi hoga
Log nange paun, bina libaas honge
Jis tarah maut hui, waise hi uthaya jaayega

🩸 Misaal: Shaheed ka khoon tapak raha hoga

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

☁️ Arsh ka Saya (Shade of the Throne)

7 log jinko Allah ke Arsh ka saya milega:
1️⃣ Adal pasand baadshah
2️⃣ Jiski jawaani ibaadat mein guzri ho
3️⃣ Jiska dil masjid se laga ho
4️⃣ Do log jo Allah ki raza ke liye milte aur juda hote hain
5️⃣ Jo ek khoobsurat aurat ka bulawa thukra de
6️⃣ Jo chhupkar sadqa de
7️⃣ Jo raat mein ibaadat kare aur akele mein aansoo bahaaye

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📜 Hisaab (Accountability)

Lamba intezaar hoga
Muhammad ﷺ ke request par hisaab shuru hoga
Sab log groups mein bat diye jaayenge
🧍‍♂️ Misaal: Jo namaz nahi padhte unko Firaun ke saath khada kiya jaayega

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

⚖️ Mizaan (Scale of Deeds)

Har shakhs ke aamaal tole jaayenge
Nek log → aamaal-naama seedhe haath mein
Bad log → aamaal-naama ulte haath mein
📖 (Surah Inshiqaaq)

🧾 Mizaan mein kya tola jaayega?

Aamaal-naama
Saaheb-e-Aamaal
Aamaal ko shakal di jaayegi

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

💧 Houz-e-Kausar (Fountain of the Prophet ﷺ)

Nabi ﷺ ko ek paak paani ka kuwan diya jaayega
Wo apni ummat ko paani pilayenge
Bid’ah karne wale logon ko wahan se door kar diya jaayega
Sunnat par chalne wale ko paani naseeb hoga

💦 Houz-e-Kausar ka paani:

Doodh se zyada safed
Shahad se zyada meetha
Barf se zyada thanda
Jo ek baar piye → kabhi pyaas nahi lagegi

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🌉 Siraat (Bridge over Hellfire)

Jannat aur Jahannum ke darmiyaan ek pul hoga
Baal se zyada bareek
Kuch log bijli ki tarah paar karenge ⚡
Kuch log reng kar paar karenge 🐍
Kuch logon ko poora noor milega, kuch ko angoothay barabar noor

____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🕌 Jannat mein Daakhila (Entry to Paradise)

Sabse pehle Muhammad ﷺ jannat mein daakhil honge
Jannatiyon ke dil saaf kar diye jaayenge
Jannat ke 8 darwaaze hain
🌿 Misaal:Roza rakhne wale → Baab-ur-Rayyan se daakhil honge
Abu Bakr Siddiq (RA) → sab 8 darwaazon se pukare jaayenge

🌸 Nabi ﷺ ko 3 baar shafaat (intercession) ka mauqa milega

Allah ke izn se kuch logon ko Jahannum se nikaalenge

🐸 Maut ka Khatma (End of Death)

Maut ko ek maindak (frog) ki shakal mein laaya jaayega
Usse Jannat aur Jahannum ke beech zabah kiya jaayega
Iske baad:
🌺 Jannati → hamesha Jannat mein
🔥 Jahannumi → hamesha Jahannum mein

